OL,3,GNEWSAArtist uses show to address
OL,4,Aviolence against women
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artist using theatre to explore
OL,7,Fthemes of surviving sexual violence and
OL,8,Fharassment has said performing is
OL,9,F"cathartic and challenging at the same
OL,10,Ftime".
OL,12,FDr Prathiba Batley, founder of Eyakkam
OL,13,FDance Theatre in Huddersfield, uses
OL,14,Fdance, spoken word and music in her
OL,15,Fshow 1,000 Papercuts to highlight her
OL,16,Fown experiences.
OL,18,FThrough different forms, including
OL,19,FBharatanatyam - an Indian dance style -
OL,20,Fand playing the cajon drum, she said
OL,21,Fshe could "democratise art forms" and
OL,22,Faddress stereotypes.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
