OL,3,GNEWSAArtist uses show to address
OL,4,Aviolence against women
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Most women, especially South Asian
OL,7,Fwomen, are expected to sit with their
OL,8,Flegs crossed. We don't make noise, we
OL,9,Fdon't talk too much. Here I am, saying,
OL,10,F'I'm going to sit on this cajon, I'm
OL,11,Fgoing to make noise'."
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
